{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>西沙SIERRA SEA三房3萬租出 業主買入即享4.1厘回報｜入伙盤租賃</p>\n<p>中原地產駿景園分行首席分區營業經理陳韻兒表示，近期市場租賃交投氣氛向好，西沙SIERRA SEA最新錄1A(2)期1座低層A室，單位實用面積702方呎，三房連套房間隔，叫價約33,000元，日前雙方議價後以3萬元租出，呎租約42.7元。</p>\n<p>陳韻兒表示，新租客為外區客，見屋苑樓齡新，環境舒適，單位間隔合用，即決定租入單位自住。據了解，業主於2025年以881萬元購入單位，是次租出單位可享約4.1厘租金回報。</p>\n<h3>即睇西沙SIERRA SEA租盤 (House730)</h3>\n<img alt=\"護脊床褥點揀好？睡姿、體重都係選購關鍵（am730製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/s3fs-public/styles/article_image/public/2025-04/cropped-images/gallery/157/default/1_70.jpg?updatedAt=1764797293\"/>\n<img alt=\"護脊床褥點揀好？重要性（am730製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/s3fs-public/styles/article_image/public/2025-04/cropped-images/gallery/157/default/2_67.jpg?updatedAt=1764797293\"/>\n<img alt=\"護脊床褥點揀好？四大要點1.承托力（am730製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/s3fs-public/styles/article_image/public/2025-04/cropped-images/gallery/157/default/3_54.jpg?updatedAt=1764797293\"/>\n<img alt=\"護脊床褥點揀好？四大要點2.軟硬度（am730製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/s3fs-public/styles/article_image/public/2025-04/cropped-images/gallery/157/default/4_40.jpg?updatedAt=1764797293\"/>\n<img alt=\"護脊床褥點揀好？四大要點3.物料與設計（am730製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/s3fs-public/styles/article_image/public/2025-04/cropped-images/gallery/157/default/5_37.jpg?updatedAt=1764797293\"/>\n<img alt=\"護脊床褥點揀好？四大要點4.耐用度（am730製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/s3fs-public/styles/article_image/public/2025-04/cropped-images/gallery/157/default/6_31.jpg?updatedAt=1764797293\"/>\n<p>ADVERTISEMENT</p>\n<img alt=\"ad\" src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/media/2026-04/01KQ9D5ZRN7XDT5D9W00KP3Z3D/01KQ9D5ZRN7XDT5D9W00KP3Z3D.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-24T23:38:19.836815+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":7,"source":"am730","fallback":"unknown"}}